"releaseNotes":"theCut is the #1 Barber Booking App. We are constantly improving our platform to deliver you the best experience. This release contains the latest user experience enhancements, stability improvements, and app optimizations. Update your app for the latest features.", "trackId":1101408626, "trackName":"theCut: Find & Book Barbers", "releaseDate":"2016-05-03T21:48:42Z", "primaryGenreName":"Lifestyle", "primaryGenreId":6012, "genreIds":["6012", "6005"], "sellerName":"theCut Inc", "version":"1.120.0", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"I needed a barber. Fast.\nBig weekend coming up.\nMy barber? Fully booked.\nSo I downloaded theCut.\nWithin minutes, I was scrolling through barbers near me — real photos, real reviews, real work. I could search for exactly what I wanted: fades, braids, twists, locs.\nI filtered by price and location, tapped “Available Now,” and found someone with an opening… even running a promotion.\nBooked in seconds. No calls. No DMs. No waiting.\nThe cut was clean.\nAnd when it was time to pay? No cash needed — I paid and tipped using Apple Pay right in the app.\nNow I use theCut anytime I need a barber I can trust, last minute or anytime.\n\nKey Features\n\n- Find barbers available now\n- Search by style and service\n- Filter by price + location\n- View photos + reviews\n- Pay digitally, skip the ATM\n\nFor Barbers & Shop Owners\nOver 25k+ barbers trust theCut to manage schedules, accept payments, grow their brand, and run their shops seamlessly, all without extra apps or hidden fees.\n\nNearly 10 million users are already using theCut to keep their cuts fresh and their mind at peace.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.66185000000000027142732506035827100276947021484375, "sellerUrl":"https://youtu.be/JKkBkapR7eU", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"232497152", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":17643, "trackContentRating":"4+", "userRatingCount":17643}]
